OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen brings travel
OL,4,Adisruption and leaves homes without
OL,5,Apower
OL,6,
OL,7,FThousands of homes have been left
OL,8,Fwithout power as Storm Austen hits
OL,9,FWales.
OL,11,FNational Grid has reported that more
OL,12,Fthan 3,000 homes are without power
OL,13,Fbetween Milford Haven, Pembrokeshire,
OL,14,Fand Usk, Monmouthshire.
OL,16,FHundreds more lost power on Friday, but
OL,17,Fhave since been reconnected.
OL,19,FThe biggest outage is in Cardigan,
OL,20,Fwhere more than 500 homes have been
OL,21,Faffected.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
